Restore the CVITEK power-on and re-scan that the radxa fork removed. Raise
WL_REG_ON with the host gpio descriptor, then call cvi_sdio_rescan(). The
firmware gives TX credits only when the card enumerates under the driver in
bootrom mode.

--- a/src/SDIO/driver_fw/driver/aic8800/aic8800_bsp/aicsdio.c
